&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t understand. It&#039;s a humanoid, it&#039;s got the paper with the list on it, and it&#039;s even got a gimmick. How is that not Wondertainment?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TICKET NUMBER: 23452263-A&lt;/p&gt;
