&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-194828-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Between 5 and 6 years of age.&lt;/div&gt;
